      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this really weird pain in my chest and kind of ripping feeling in my upper back today. it started like an hour ago and it just wont go away. i think maybe i strained something at the gym or it might just be bad indigestion from lunch? what do you think i should do to help it go down?",
