      "content": "Given that your symptoms started suddenly and are persistent, it may be necessary for you to seek professional medical attention promptly. Unexpected pain in your chest or upper back could be caused by various issues that may require immediate attention. Try some deep breathing exercises or gentle stretching, but don't disregard the potential severity of your symptoms and consult with a doctor as soon as possible. If the pain worsens or new symptoms emerge, such as difficulty breathing or sweating, call emergency services immediately.",
